</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effects of black tea extract on carbon tetrachloride-induced lipid peroxidation in liver, kidneys, and testes of rats</article-title><source>Phytother Res</source><year>2002</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>S28</fpage><lpage>32</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11933136</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Young</surname><given-names>SC</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>CJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Lin</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Peng</surname><given-names>PL</given-names></name><name><surname>Hsu</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name><name><surname>Chou</surname><given-names>FP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Protection effect of piper betel leaf extract against carbon tetrachloride-induced liver fibrosis in rats</article-title><source>Arch Toxicol</source><year>2006</year><volume>81</volume><fpage>45</fpage><lpage>55</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16676162</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Christina</surname><given-names>AJM</given-names></name><name><surname>Saraawathy</surname><given-names>GR</given-names></name><name><surname>Heison Robert</surname><given-names>SJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Kothai</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Chidambaranathan</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Nalini</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Therasal</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Inhibition of CCl4 induced liver fibrosis by Piper Longum Linn</article-title><source>Phytomedicine</source><year>2006</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>196</fpage><lpage>198</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16428029</pub-id></cit